#
# N2 - a continuation record claiming both resume and repeat. The two carry different
# required bindings and different consequences, so a record claiming both has not said
# which happened. MUST trip logic:ContinuationKindDisjointnessConstraint.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/logic/tests/> .

ex:conflatedContinuation logic:continuationKind logic:ContinuationResume ,
        logic:ContinuationRepeat ;
    rdfs:label "a continuation claiming to be both a resume and a repeat"@en .
